# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository *and* in the working
# tree, on every platform. Without this, core.autocrlf (on by default in
# Git for Windows) checks files out as CRLF here but LF on macOS/Linux,
# so clones from the slides differ from the author's copy.
#
# No .bat/.cmd/.ps1 files are tracked, so nothing here needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
